{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["לאמר אליהם — to Moshe and to Aharon." "למשה ולאהרן — from this one may prove, regarding every לאמר in Scripture together with וידבר YHWH אל משה, that its meaning is לאמר למשה. And since above the speech was singled out for Aharon alone, here לאמר אליהם is stated, to both of them."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:48:51.937101359Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}